{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年。春王二月辛卯，衞寗喜弒其君剽。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"二、衞孫林父入于戚以叛。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"三、甲午，衞侯衎復歸于衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"此諼君以弒也，其言復歸何？惡剽也。曷為惡剽？剽之立於是未有說也。然則曷為不言剽之立？不言剽之立者，以惡衞侯也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"四、夏，晉侯使荀吳來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"五、公會晉人、鄭良霄、宋人、曹人于澶淵。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"六、秋，宋公殺其世子痤。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"七、晉人執衞寗喜。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"此執有罪，何以不得為伯討？不以其罪執之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"八、八月壬午，許男寗卒于楚。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"九、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_175_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_175","textTraditional":"十、葬許靈公。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}